---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 25, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure — Love Heat Relationship">
  <div class="legal-page mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="mb-2 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-text">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="legal-page__updated mb-6 text-xs text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="legal-page__body space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <p>In accordance with the FTC's Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials, this page discloses that Love Heat Relationship ("LHR," "we," "us") earns money from some of the links on this Site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Amazon Associates</h2>
        <p>Love Heat Relationship is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Other affiliate programs</h2>
        <p>Beyond Amazon, some kitchenware and product links on the Site go to other retailers and vendors through their own affiliate or referral programs. When you click one of those links and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">What this means for you</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Any commission we earn comes out of the retailer's margin — it never adds to the price you pay.</li>
          <li>We only link to products we've actually used and would recommend regardless of commission; the kitchenware sets and ingredients featured on this Site are the real ones used in the recipes and photos.</li>
          <li>You're never obligated to use our links, and doing so doesn't create any additional relationship between you and LHR.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Where you'll see this</h2>
        <p>Individual affiliate links and product cards throughout the Site (for example, in recipe and article posts) carry their own short "(affiliate link)" label at the point of the link, in addition to this page. Clicking a link takes you to a third-party site; see our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-accent underline">Privacy Policy</a> for how that click is recorded (a privacy-friendly analytics event tied to the link, not to you personally) and how third-party sites handle your information once you're there.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this disclosure? Email <a href="mailto:hello@loveheatrelationship.com" class="text-accent underline">hello@loveheatrelationship.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
